@startuml
[*] --> Marking Tasks
[*] --> Checking Overlaps

Marking Tasks --> [*] : Mark Task
Marking Tasks --> Checking Overlaps : Mark Multiple Tasks

Checking Overlaps --> No Overlaps Found : No Overlaps
Checking Overlaps --> Displaying Overlaps : Overlaps Found

No Overlaps Found --> [*] : Close

Displaying Overlaps --> Editing Task : Edit Task
Displaying Overlaps --> [*] : Close

Editing Task --> [*] : Save Changes
@enduml
